00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.240 line:100%
Thank you, Officer Ran.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:45.760 line:100%
Oh, what's with all these gifts?

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:48.280 line:100%
-You shouldn't have.
-Chinese New Year is almost here.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.360 line:100%
Anyway, Officer Ran,

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.000 line:100%
about the person named Yao Xincheng

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.080 line:100%
you asked about,

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:57.280 line:100%
I really don't remember anything.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:00.600 line:100%
I never heard Uncle or Mengmeng
mention that name either.

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.360 line:100%
Uncle and Mengmeng
have been gone for five years now.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:04.760 line:100%
The police also announced that.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.080 line:100%
Wasn't the killer already dead?

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.320 line:100%
How is this still not over?

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:20.360 line:100%
If the truth hasn't come out,
how can it be over?

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.120 line:100%
Even if I'm gone,

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:25.920 line:100%
other police officers
will keep investigating.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.080 line:100%
Right.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.200 line:100%
Please think carefully again.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.720 line:100%
<i>What did Officer Ran say to you?</i>

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.360 line:100%
<i>What did he ask about?</i>

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:38.400 line:100%
I remember

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.400 line:100%
Officer Ran made a phone call here.

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.320 line:100%
He called someone

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:46.240 line:100%
with a two-character name.
Something Qiang.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:47.720 line:100%
Qiang?

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.200 line:100%
Ma Qiang…

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.080 line:100%
-Was it Ma Qiang?
-<i>Yes.</i>

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.520 line:100%
<i>That's it. Ma Qiang.</i>

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.680 line:100%
Ma Qiang… One moment.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.240 line:100%
Right away.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.080 line:100%
Alright. You can send it now.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.600 line:100%
<i>Officer Ran, other than 1997 and 2002,</i>

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:12.000 line:100%
-<i>do you want the rest too?</i>
-Yes.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.160 line:100%
I have those two years.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.840 line:100%
Please send me the resident lists

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.640 line:100%
-for all the other years.
-<i>Alright. Right away.</i>

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:33.120 line:100%
RESIDENT LIST

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.640 line:100%
POLICE INTELLIGENCE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:52.720 line:100%
"YAO XINCHENG" SEARCH RESULTS

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:56.920 line:100%
DAD

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.120 line:100%
Dad,

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.640 line:100%
I've searched both the internal network
and the public internet.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:04.760 line:100%
There are all kinds of Yao Xinchengs.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:05.520 line:100%
"YAO XINCHENG" SEARCH RESULTS

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.640 line:100%
Either they're not in Weiyang

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:09.200 line:100%
or they don't match Mr. Lu's description.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.400 line:100%
Any leads on your side?

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:14.520 line:100%
Xu Meng's family doesn't know this person.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.920 line:100%
I also asked Su Yuzhi and Lili.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.720 line:100%
<i>They don't know this name either.</i>

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.720 line:100%
Qian Dajun cut the power again!

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.880 line:100%
Tomorrow, I'll cut his life short!

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.040 line:100%
<i>Dad.</i>

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.920 line:100%
Is everything alright in Yuanlongli?

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.000 line:100%
<i>Is Qian Dajun starting something again?</i>

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.000 line:100%
He's long gone now.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.080 line:100%
After smashing the windows last night,

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.080 line:100%
everyone's waiting to deal with him.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.920 line:100%
Kiddo, go to work tomorrow.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.200 line:100%
If I find any clues here,
I'll let you know.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.520 line:100%
-Hello?
-Hello?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.080 line:100%
Dad?

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.520 line:100%
NO SERVICE

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.040 line:100%
Jeez.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.880 line:100%
Ma Qiang.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:01.640 line:100%
Mr. He.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.760 line:100%
I called you. Why didn't you answer?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.640 line:100%
I'm sorry, Mr. He.
I was with Mr. Qian all night.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.840 line:100%
I didn't dare answer. What do you need?

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.920 line:100%
The night before New Year's Eve in 2003,

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.400 line:100%
did Officer Ran call you?

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.680 line:100%
That was so long ago.
How could I remember?

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:23.200 line:100%
The day before Ran passed away.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:31.000 line:100%
Yes, I remember now. Officer Ran
called me then and asked

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.440 line:100%
for Yuanlongli's resident lists
from the past years.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.920 line:100%
Later, he came
to the property office himself

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.200 line:100%
and even brought New Year gifts.

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:37.640 line:100%
YUANLONGLI PROPERTY MANAGEMENT

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:40.000 line:100%
Thank you, Officer Ran. You're too kind.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.160 line:100%
You still remember us.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.160 line:100%
Have a seat.

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:44.360 line:100%
Please sit.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:48.440 line:100%
It's almost Chinese New Year.
You all work hard year-round.

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:53.440 line:100%
Our job can't compare to yours at all.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.480 line:100%
By the way,

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:58.320 line:100%
do you remember
if there was someone in Yuanlongli

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.720 line:100%
named Yao Xincheng?

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:00.560 line:100%
Yao Xincheng?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.400 line:100%
I really don't know.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.720 line:100%
What about relatives of the residents?

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.080 line:100%
I know even less about that.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.080 line:100%
Where's Mr. Qian?

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:15.960 line:100%
I called him several times,
but he didn't answer.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:19.000 line:100%
Mr. Qian went out
this afternoon for business drinks.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:22.360 line:100%
At this hour,
he's probably hammered already.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:24.920 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.240 line:100%
I'm about to head back
to my village for Chinese New Year.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.880 line:100%
Wang Xinglong is on duty tomorrow.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:29.840 line:100%
How about this?

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.320 line:100%
I'll leave a note for Mr. Qian.

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.400 line:100%
When he sees it, he'll call you back.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.120 line:100%
Alright.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.600 line:100%
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.080 line:100%
Officer Ran.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:45.600 line:100%
You mentioned this Yao Xincheng.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:48.240 line:100%
Does he have anything to do
with Yuanlongli?

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.600 line:100%
If he has nothing to do
with Yuanlongli either,

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:02.360 line:100%
then I don't know where I can go next.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:08.120 line:100%
And then?

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.320 line:100%
And then…

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.800 line:100%
That was all.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:15.800 line:100%
When Officer Ran left,
he looked pretty disappointed.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:23.480 line:100%
I never thought

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:28.120 line:100%
that would be the last time I saw him.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:15.280 line:20%
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.200 line:100%
<i>Say, sir,</i>

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:18.480 line:100%
<i>do you remember the blue leather heels</i>
<i>from the June 30th case?</i>

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.000 line:100%
<i>The blue leather heels</i>
<i>were tall and eye-catching.</i>

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.040 line:100%
<i>They were definitely real.</i>

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:22.960 line:100%
BLUE LEATHER HEELS
LILI

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:23.880 line:100%
DU MINGLIANG'S MOTHER

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.520 line:100%
<i>You should ask those who sell fake shoes.</i>

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.200 line:100%
<i>They would definitely know.</i>

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:30.840 line:100%
<i>Judging by the finish and workmanship,</i>

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:33.520 line:100%
<i>that should be the work</i>
<i>of Mr. Lu from Pingzhao County.</i>

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:36.400 line:100%
<i>It was a perfectly real pair of shoes,</i>
<i>yet he insisted I make them look fake.</i>

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.440 line:100%
<i>He was a man in his thirties.</i>

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:39.479 line:100%
SHOEMAKER MR. LU
MAN WITH THREE CIGARETTE BURN MARKS

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:42.240 line:20%
<i>He had three burn marks on his arm.</i>

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.680 line:100%
<i>There's a loose thread here.</i>

00:08:45.760 --> 00:08:46.760 line:100%
<i>How did I never notice it before?</i>

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:47.520 line:100%
BOWLS DRESS

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.120 line:100%
<i>According to the dry-cleaning records,</i>

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:52.840 line:100%
<i>the buyer of this dress</i>
<i>was named Yao Xincheng.</i>

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:56.040 line:100%
<i>If he has nothing to do with Yuanlongli,</i>

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:59.000 line:100%
<i>then I don't know where I can go next.</i>

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.360 line:100%
Ran.

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:25.040 line:100%
How did you continue the investigation?

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:51.800 line:100%
Sir,

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.560 line:100%
if you were me,

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:57.280 line:100%
how would you continue the investigation?

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:42.520 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:46.680 line:100%
LOYAL AND TRUE

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:51.360 line:100%
Hello, Dad?

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.920 line:100%
What did you find?

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:56.280 line:100%
-I'm going home.
-What? Not investigating anymore?

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.760 line:100%
<i>I was thinking</i>
<i>I would come to your place after work.</i>

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.720 line:100%
The trail went cold.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.640 line:100%
I don't want to stay stuck
in Yuanlongli anymore.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:04.760 line:100%
I'll head home

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:06.880 line:100%
and think about the next move.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:08.680 line:100%
Alright then.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.760 line:100%
I'll help you move after work.

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:13.760 line:100%
No need. You take care of your work.

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:16.520 line:100%
I can handle these myself.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:18.960 line:100%
Dad,

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:20.600 line:100%
are you alright?

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.400 line:100%
Why wouldn't I be?

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.160 line:100%
Just focus on your job.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:31.680 line:100%
<i>If I find any new clues,</i>
<i>I'll tell you right away.</i>

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:37.320 line:100%
Don't worry. In my life,
there's no such word as giving up.

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:38.840 line:100%
I'm hanging up.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:29.920 line:100%
Coming.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:35.960 line:100%
Who is it?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.600 line:100%
Officer He, morning.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.440 line:100%
Manager Ma sent me over
to bring you hot water.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:46.920 line:100%
There's no need.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.920 line:100%
I'm moving out soon anyway.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.480 line:100%
Are you moving out?

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.040 line:100%
That's great.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:56.640 line:100%
I'll give you a hand.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:58.920 line:100%
No need. You go get busy.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.000 line:100%
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.840 line:100%
Poor Officer Ran.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.800 line:100%
Speaking of that,

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:17.320 line:100%
before he passed, I saw him one last time.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.080 line:100%
Then…

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:25.320 line:100%
What did you say?

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.560 line:100%
You saw him? When?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.600 line:100%
On New Year's Eve morning.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:34.440 line:100%
In this building.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.680 line:100%
Who the heck is that?

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.360 line:100%
I'm sorry, Wang Xinglong.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:49.800 line:100%
Officer Ran?

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.040 line:100%
It's alright.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.840 line:100%
You really startled me.

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.640 line:100%
<i>When he came out of the elevator,</i>
<i>he scared me.</i>

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.200 line:100%
His eyes were bloodshot.

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:58.640 line:100%
He clearly didn't sleep all night.

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.320 line:100%
<i>Then he rushed off in a hurry.</i>

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.400 line:100%
Must've been heading off
to something urgent.

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.000 line:100%
Are you sure
it was New Year's Eve morning?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.800 line:100%
I'm sure. Eight in the morning.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:16.520 line:100%
It was a property management rule.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.960 line:100%
Eight a.m. Patrol the building at 8 a.m.

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:21.600 line:100%
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.040 line:100%
SAVED TIME: 2003-01-31
13:09:37, RECIPIENT: SIR

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.520 line:100%
RAN: SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE IS WRONG
THE WHOLE THING IS WRONG

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:33.920 line:100%
Thank you.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.840 line:100%
You did me a big favor.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:40.320 line:100%
Wait, Mr. He… Weren't you moving out?

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:41.240 line:100%
Why are you moving things back in?

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:43.760 line:100%
I'm not moving anymore.
Absolutely not moving.

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:47.720 line:100%
By the way,
go find Qian Dajun now and tell him

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:50.600 line:100%
I'm staying in Yuanlongli,
and I'll fight him to the end.

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:53.880 line:100%
That's a snap decision.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:05.280 line:100%
Ran met with Ma Qiang

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.400 line:100%
the night before New Year's Eve.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.080 line:100%
Then on New Year's Eve morning,

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:13.000 line:100%
he ran out of the building again.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.560 line:100%
His eyes were red with exhaustion.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:20.840 line:100%
That afternoon, he drafted a message to me

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.880 line:100%
saying the June 30th case was all wrong.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:28.120 line:100%
He must have found something.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:32.080 line:100%
He must have found something
in this building.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:33.000 line:100%
<i>CRIMINAL CASE STUDIES</i>

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:38.080 line:20%
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:41.520 line:100%
Ran,

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:44.040 line:100%
what did you find?

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:24.280 line:100%
SIR

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:47.680 line:100%
<i>In four hours,</i>
<i>we'll welcome the Chinese New Year.</i>

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.600 line:100%
<i>On the last night</i>
<i>before the fresh new year,</i>

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:53.720 line:100%
<i>are you, listening to the radio,</i>
<i>on your way to reunite with your family?</i>

00:17:56.800 --> 00:18:00.560 line:100%
BLESSING

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:23.680 line:100%
Why won't he answer?

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.120 line:100%
Dad, don't worry.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.560 line:100%
Uncle Ran has probably gone
to pick up Ms. Qiao.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:34.000 line:100%
See? Here they are.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.000 line:100%
Coming.

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.760 line:100%
-Qiao.
-Officer He.

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:41.880 line:100%
Ms. Qiao.

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.600 line:100%
-Xiaohe.
-Come in.

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:44.360 line:100%
Sure.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:46.680 line:100%
Ran didn't come with you?

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:51.280 line:100%
I thought something had come up
at work and kept him busy.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:54.000 line:100%
He was supposed to pick me up from work.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.600 line:100%
I waited, and he never showed.

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:57.640 line:100%
He didn't answer my calls either.

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.200 line:100%
I was worried
you would all be waiting too long,

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.320 line:100%
so I took a taxi here.

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.120 line:100%
That brat.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.120 line:100%
What is he busy with on New Year's Eve?

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:09.040 line:100%
Maybe he left his phone back at work.

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:12.160 line:100%
It's raining hard outside today.
The roads are bad.

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:13.480 line:100%
Let's wait for him.

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:16.000 line:100%
Alright. Let's go inside.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:19.600 line:100%
Officer He, I'm not good at picking gifts,

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.240 line:100%
so I brought some supplements.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:22.880 line:100%
Just having you here is enough.

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.560 line:100%
You don't have to bring
anything next time.

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.640 line:100%
Xiaohe, help Ms. Qiao change clothes

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:27.680 line:100%
-and get her a pair of slippers.
-Okay.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.160 line:100%
I'll finish wrapping dumplings.

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:31.920 line:100%
-Ms. Qiao, here.
-Thank you.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:36.120 line:100%
Come. New Year's gift.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.960 line:100%
We have the same scarf.
Thank you, Ms. Qiao.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:43.080 line:100%
You're welcome.

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:46.560 line:100%
Have a seat.

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:47.480 line:100%
Sure.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.280 line:100%
This scarf matches my hairstyle perfectly.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.920 line:100%
By the way,
did Uncle Ran get you a gift too?

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.080 line:100%
Oh…

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.560 line:100%
Looks like the answer is obvious.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.640 line:100%
Officer He, I'll help.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.520 line:100%
Alright. Good to have extra hands.

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:16.600 line:100%
Qiao,

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:20.280 line:100%
my apprentice is good in every way.

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.120 line:100%
Stable job.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:24.240 line:100%
Good character.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.800 line:100%
Only one flaw.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.000 line:100%
Other than solving cases,
he never takes the initiative in anything.

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:34.880 line:100%
You see, as his mentor,
when it comes to marriage,

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.920 line:100%
I can count as half a parent.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:39.440 line:100%
Look,

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:40.840 line:100%
Xiaohe likes you so much.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.520 line:100%
Our big family here
just happens to be missing one person.

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:46.880 line:100%
We genuinely hope
you'll become that person.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.080 line:100%
That's right, Ms. Qiao.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:52.120 line:100%
From the first time I met you,
I felt like you would become family.

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:54.040 line:100%
Once Uncle Ran gets here,

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.440 line:100%
I'm calling you Mrs. Ran.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.360 line:100%
Qiao,

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.400 line:100%
no matter how things develop
between you and Ran later,

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.440 line:100%
fast or slow, that's between you two.

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:05.440 line:100%
I won't interfere.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:07.080 line:100%
But one thing I'll say first.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.480 line:100%
This home will be your home from now on.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.960 line:100%
We gather like this
every holiday and festival.

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:44.600 line:100%
In a little while,
the New Year bell will ring.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.480 line:100%
I should make a wish.

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:48.760 line:100%
I wish our whole family

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.760 line:100%
happiness and many blessings.

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:57.920 line:100%
Thank you,

00:21:58.440 --> 00:21:59.280 line:100%
Officer He.

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:01.320 line:100%
Thank you, Xiaohe.

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:04.640 line:100%
And even more, I should thank Ran.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:07.400 line:100%
Thank you all

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.400 line:100%
for making me feel
what having a family is like.

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:12.560 line:100%
That's my wish too.

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:15.480 line:100%
My New Year's wish.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:19.520 line:100%
Why thank us?

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:22.240 line:100%
From now on, we're family.

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:23.680 line:100%
No need for thanks between family.

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:25.320 line:100%
Exactly.

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:27.440 line:100%
No worries there, Mrs. Ran.

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:31.840 line:100%
<i>I want love to live in my home every day</i>

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:33.280 line:100%
<i>Day and night</i>

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:35.240 line:100%
<i>Through all four seasons</i>

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:36.840 line:100%
<i>With our hearts</i>

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:38.680 line:100%
<i>Loving our home</i>

00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:42.080 line:100%
<i>I want love to live in your home every day</i>

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:45.400 line:100%
<i>I want love to live in my home every day</i>

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:47.040 line:100%
<i>Filled with joy</i>

00:22:47.120 --> 00:22:49.320 line:100%
<i>Safe and blessed</i>

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:50.760 line:100%
<i>Love stays in our home</i>

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:51.520 line:100%
RAN

00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:55.160 line:100%
<i>Forever</i>

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:34.440 line:100%
SIR

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:06.040 line:100%
It's mainly because of the oil drums.

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:08.680 line:100%
Recheck the scene.

00:24:10.600 --> 00:24:13.120 line:100%
Director Zou, this belongs to Captain Ran.

00:24:16.560 --> 00:24:17.880 line:100%
It's burned in the fire.

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:22.160 line:100%
There are no cameras on this road.

00:24:22.920 --> 00:24:24.480 line:100%
Based on our initial investigation,

00:24:25.000 --> 00:24:27.520 line:100%
the accident was likely caused
by poorly stored materials

00:24:27.600 --> 00:24:29.360 line:100%
at this construction site.

00:24:30.360 --> 00:24:32.360 line:100%
Strong wind knocked over two fuel drums.

00:24:32.920 --> 00:24:34.080 line:100%
It was raining hard and dark outside.

00:24:35.440 --> 00:24:36.880 line:100%
Oil spilled onto the road,
making it slippery.

00:24:38.080 --> 00:24:41.200 line:100%
When the vehicle passed through,
it would've been hard to keep control.

00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:44.040 line:100%
That's why Captain Ran…

00:24:46.320 --> 00:24:47.960 line:100%
Coordinate with the criminal department.

00:24:48.560 --> 00:24:50.160 line:100%
You must get to the bottom of this.

00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:54.720 line:100%
He was a good coworker

00:24:54.800 --> 00:24:56.320 line:100%
and a good comrade.

00:24:58.640 --> 00:24:59.960 line:100%
It's heartbreaking.

00:25:09.880 --> 00:25:11.200 line:100%
Uncle Ran!

00:25:11.800 --> 00:25:13.120 line:100%
Uncle Ran!

00:25:13.200 --> 00:25:14.520 line:100%
-Uncle Ran!
-Xiaohe.

00:25:15.320 --> 00:25:16.680 line:100%
Don't go over there.

00:25:16.760 --> 00:25:20.360 line:100%
Don't. Xiaohe, don't go over there.

00:29:00.360 --> 00:29:01.520 line:100%
Ran.

00:29:04.760 --> 00:29:05.960 line:100%
It's Chinese New Year.

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:19.480 line:100%
It's Chinese New Year.

00:29:31.880 --> 00:29:33.680 line:100%
<i>Wishing everyone a Happy Chinese New Year!</i>

00:29:33.760 --> 00:29:35.480 line:100%
-<i>Wish you a happy Year of the Goat!</i>
-<i>Happy New Year!</i>

00:29:35.560 --> 00:29:37.440 line:100%
<i>Happy Chinese New Year!</i>

00:29:37.520 --> 00:29:40.240 line:100%
<i>Dear friends, at this exciting moment,</i>

00:29:40.320 --> 00:29:42.240 line:100%
<i>we send to people</i>
<i>of all ethnic groups across the nation,</i>

00:29:42.320 --> 00:29:43.920 line:100%
<i>to our compatriots</i>

00:29:44.000 --> 00:29:44.960 line:100%
<i>in Hong Kong, China,</i>
<i>Macau Special Administrative Region,</i>

00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:48.080 line:100%
<i>Taiwan, China, and to Chinese people</i>
<i>all around the world</i>

00:29:48.160 --> 00:29:49.000 line:100%
<i>our New Year greetings.</i>

00:29:49.080 --> 00:29:52.600 line:100%
<i>Crossing the threshold of time,</i>
<i>we step into the embrace of spring.</i>

00:29:52.680 --> 00:29:54.760 line:100%
<i>Happy Spring Festival!</i>

00:30:13.320 --> 00:30:17.960 line:100%
RAN FANGXU, MALE, CREMATION IN PROGRESS

00:30:18.040 --> 00:30:21.560 line:100%
IN PROGRESS

00:30:25.240 --> 00:30:27.400 line:20%
IN MOURNING

00:30:50.040 --> 00:30:51.680 line:100%
Xiaohe, where are you going?

00:31:10.760 --> 00:31:12.560 line:100%
-I win.
-That's your…

00:31:12.640 --> 00:31:13.960 line:100%
Someone's here.

00:31:14.040 --> 00:31:15.960 line:100%
LANYA HAIR SALON

00:31:16.040 --> 00:31:18.120 line:100%
FULL SALON SERVICES
CUTS, COLORS &amp; STYLES

00:31:18.200 --> 00:31:19.760 line:100%
We're closed today.

00:31:21.840 --> 00:31:23.080 line:100%
I need a haircut.

00:31:36.920 --> 00:31:37.760 line:100%
<i>Xiaohe.</i>

00:31:38.400 --> 00:31:39.760 line:100%
Say hi to Uncle Ran.

00:31:40.800 --> 00:31:42.240 line:100%
Hello, Xiaohe.

00:31:46.960 --> 00:31:48.320 line:100%
This is for you.

00:31:48.400 --> 00:31:49.720 line:100%
<i>Thank you, Uncle Ran.</i>

00:31:58.080 --> 00:31:59.760 line:100%
Let go of me. I'm not going with you.

00:31:59.840 --> 00:32:01.920 line:100%
I even treated you as my best friend!

00:32:05.280 --> 00:32:07.520 line:100%
Xiaohe, I owe you an apology.

00:32:07.600 --> 00:32:11.440 line:100%
The way you acted in the traffickers' van
was brave and smart.

00:32:11.520 --> 00:32:13.080 line:100%
You surely are cut out for a detective.

00:32:16.720 --> 00:32:18.440 line:100%
From now on, you teach me music notation,

00:32:18.520 --> 00:32:19.760 line:100%
I teach you criminal investigation.

00:32:19.840 --> 00:32:20.840 line:100%
We'll learn from each other.

00:32:21.440 --> 00:32:23.680 line:100%
-Deal.
-Deal.

00:32:43.840 --> 00:32:45.960 line:20%
RAN 1972-2003

00:33:02.480 --> 00:33:07.560 line:100%
TOMB OF RAN FANGXU

00:33:07.640 --> 00:33:08.680 line:100%
First bow.

00:33:13.320 --> 00:33:14.160 line:100%
Second bow.

00:33:24.720 --> 00:33:25.640 line:100%
Third bow.

00:33:41.240 --> 00:33:42.320 line:100%
Uncle Ran.

00:36:25.560 --> 00:36:26.840 line:100%
Hello. My surname is Ran.

00:36:26.920 --> 00:36:29.080 line:100%
-Ran as in rising upward.
-This is my apprentice.

00:36:29.160 --> 00:36:30.280 line:100%
I'm not.

00:36:31.400 --> 00:36:32.080 line:100%
He's not my mentor.

00:36:33.080 --> 00:36:34.360 line:100%
Let me say this again.

00:36:34.440 --> 00:36:35.480 line:100%
I am not your apprentice.

00:36:38.480 --> 00:36:39.400 line:100%
He Yuanhang!

00:36:39.480 --> 00:36:40.800 line:100%
I got him! He Yuanhang.

00:36:40.880 --> 00:36:42.640 line:100%
He Yuanhang,
you're not fit to be a detective!

00:36:42.720 --> 00:36:43.680 line:100%
MISSING PERSON

00:36:51.600 --> 00:36:54.600 line:100%
I'll follow your lead.
Let's do the plan you talked about.

00:36:54.680 --> 00:36:57.160 line:100%
This time, you're the one who begged me.

00:36:57.840 --> 00:36:58.920 line:100%
Aren't we partners?

00:37:00.320 --> 00:37:02.640 line:100%
Look at you.
You work pretty well together.

00:37:16.120 --> 00:37:17.320 line:100%
He!

00:37:18.160 --> 00:37:19.280 line:100%
He!

00:37:21.040 --> 00:37:21.920 line:100%
He!

00:37:22.440 --> 00:37:24.200 line:100%
Don't sleep, He.

00:37:24.280 --> 00:37:25.920 line:20%
Comrade He Yuanhang, you're hereby awarded

00:37:26.000 --> 00:37:27.440 line:100%
Second-class Merit for Individual Service.

00:37:40.560 --> 00:37:41.760 line:100%
I'm leaving,

00:37:42.720 --> 00:37:43.680 line:100%
sir.

00:37:53.400 --> 00:37:54.320 line:100%
Kiddo.

00:37:55.880 --> 00:37:57.400 line:100%
I only ask one thing of you.

00:37:58.400 --> 00:37:59.400 line:100%
Dad,

00:38:00.120 --> 00:38:01.040 line:100%
say no more.

00:38:01.960 --> 00:38:05.000 line:100%
After the holiday,
I'll go back to school and study.

00:38:05.600 --> 00:38:06.520 line:100%
I'll apply to the police academy

00:38:07.400 --> 00:38:08.640 line:20%
and become a detective.

00:38:09.240 --> 00:38:10.320 line:100%
I'll solve cases

00:38:11.400 --> 00:38:12.800 line:100%
and finish the shifts

00:38:13.560 --> 00:38:15.840 line:100%
for you all that you never got to finish.

00:38:24.280 --> 00:38:27.600 line:100%
TOMB OF RAN FANGXU

00:38:27.680 --> 00:38:28.840 line:100%
Uncle Ran,

00:38:29.720 --> 00:38:31.160 line:100%
I'm not going to Beijing anymore.

00:38:32.120 --> 00:38:35.680 line:100%
No matter how cold or heavy something is,

00:38:36.200 --> 00:38:37.960 line:100%
I'll carry it myself.

00:38:38.040 --> 00:38:40.000 line:100%
I'll carry it all by myself.

00:39:17.840 --> 00:39:21.320 line:20%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH

00:39:23.080 --> 00:39:25.960 line:100%
<i>Wang Xinglong said</i>
<i>the night before New Year's Eve,</i>

00:39:26.040 --> 00:39:28.360 line:100%
<i>Ran stayed in New York Block</i>
<i>the whole night.</i>

00:39:28.440 --> 00:39:32.040 line:100%
<i>He must've found</i>
<i>some crucial information or a clue.</i>

00:39:32.120 --> 00:39:34.120 line:100%
That's why the next day
he wrote that message.

00:39:36.000 --> 00:39:38.320 line:100%
I'm not leaving this building.

00:39:38.920 --> 00:39:41.520 line:100%
I'll ask Captain Zhao
to reopen the June 30th case.

00:39:42.040 --> 00:39:44.840 line:100%
We'll reopen it, but now isn't the time.

00:39:44.920 --> 00:39:46.200 line:100%
<i>We don't have key evidence.</i>

00:39:46.280 --> 00:39:49.400 line:100%
<i>Especially this crucial person,</i>
<i>Yao Xincheng.</i>

00:39:49.480 --> 00:39:50.720 line:100%
We haven't found him yet.

00:39:51.320 --> 00:39:52.360 line:100%
Luckily,

00:39:52.440 --> 00:39:55.520 line:100%
Ran narrowed the final clue
down to Yuanlongli.

00:39:56.160 --> 00:39:57.920 line:100%
-I'll investigate with you.
-<i>No need.</i>

00:39:58.000 --> 00:39:59.960 line:100%
If we go together, we'll draw attention.

00:40:00.040 --> 00:40:02.520 line:100%
<i>It'll be easier if I work alone.</i>

00:40:02.600 --> 00:40:03.960 line:100%
<i>Get the application papers ready now.</i>

00:40:04.040 --> 00:40:05.760 line:100%
<i>Once I make progress here,</i>

00:40:05.840 --> 00:40:09.440 line:100%
go to Zhao Jie and have him coordinate
a delay to Yuanlongli's demolition.

00:40:10.360 --> 00:40:11.240 line:100%
Also…

00:40:13.480 --> 00:40:14.760 line:100%
Hello? Hello?

00:40:14.840 --> 00:40:15.880 line:100%
Hello?

00:40:17.720 --> 00:40:18.760 line:100%
Lousy signal.

00:40:19.800 --> 00:40:21.160 line:100%
NO SERVICE

00:40:23.040 --> 00:40:24.000 line:100%
Jeez.

00:40:24.720 --> 00:40:26.120 line:100%
No signal again.

00:40:42.320 --> 00:40:43.600 line:100%
Mr. He,

00:40:43.680 --> 00:40:45.000 line:100%
you went back on your word.

00:40:45.080 --> 00:40:46.800 line:100%
You said you would move out
before demolition.

00:40:46.880 --> 00:40:48.000 line:100%
You let down my trust.

00:40:49.280 --> 00:40:50.120 line:100%
Good timing.

00:40:50.200 --> 00:40:53.720 line:100%
Didn't you want me to move out early?
Find a person for me.

00:40:54.640 --> 00:40:57.400 line:100%
Ask around whether anyone
named Yao Xincheng

00:40:57.480 --> 00:41:00.360 line:100%
was living in Yuanlongli around 1997.

00:41:00.440 --> 00:41:02.920 line:100%
Or anyone who knows this person.

00:41:03.680 --> 00:41:04.880 line:100%
-Yao Xincheng?
-Right.

00:41:06.360 --> 00:41:09.000 line:100%
Never heard of any Yao Xincheng.

00:41:09.600 --> 00:41:11.800 line:100%
Mr. He, tell me honestly.

00:41:11.880 --> 00:41:13.160 line:100%
You refuse to leave here

00:41:13.240 --> 00:41:15.440 line:100%
because you want to investigate
the case from 1997 again?

00:41:16.360 --> 00:41:18.280 line:100%
Are you acting up again?

00:41:19.200 --> 00:41:20.480 line:100%
My mind is perfectly fine.

00:41:20.560 --> 00:41:22.200 line:100%
Don't listen to their nonsense.

00:41:22.920 --> 00:41:24.520 line:100%
Seems like you're still not quite right.

00:41:26.120 --> 00:41:31.000 line:100%
Mr. He, Officer Ran and you
solved the Yuanlongli case twice.

00:41:31.640 --> 00:41:33.000 line:100%
You even got a commendation
the second time.

00:41:33.080 --> 00:41:35.960 line:100%
Are you trying to overturn it
and solve it a third time?

00:41:36.480 --> 00:41:39.200 line:100%
Until the truth is found,
forget a third time.

00:41:39.280 --> 00:41:40.640 line:100%
A fourth time. A fifth time.

00:41:40.720 --> 00:41:42.880 line:100%
Even if it takes a hundred times,
I'll keep digging.

00:41:44.040 --> 00:41:46.520 line:100%
This is the task
Ran left me before he died.

00:41:46.600 --> 00:41:47.960 line:100%
If I can't finish it,

00:41:48.040 --> 00:41:50.440 line:100%
I won't have the face
to meet him down there.

00:41:54.040 --> 00:41:57.120 line:100%
This was Officer Ran's last wish?

00:41:57.200 --> 00:41:58.320 line:100%
Right.

00:42:05.080 --> 00:42:07.160 line:100%
For someone as good as Officer Ran,

00:42:07.920 --> 00:42:10.240 line:100%
I'll help with this.

00:42:10.840 --> 00:42:15.120 line:100%
Tell me. Aside from Yao Xincheng,
what else do you need me to do?

00:42:17.200 --> 00:42:20.480 line:100%
Can you restore
the signal, water, and electricity?

00:42:20.560 --> 00:42:22.320 line:100%
-Alright.
-By the way,

00:42:22.400 --> 00:42:26.680 line:100%
if possible, tell Qian Dajun
not to start demolition early.

00:42:27.440 --> 00:42:28.520 line:100%
I'll do everything I can to help.

00:42:29.160 --> 00:42:31.920 line:100%
Qian Dajun is downstairs.
Wait for my news.

00:42:32.000 --> 00:42:33.840 line:100%
Okay?

00:42:47.760 --> 00:42:52.520 line:20%
ROUND 4 OF THE TRÉMAUX ALGORITHM
ON THE YUANLONGLI CASE

00:43:08.800 --> 00:43:09.760 line:20%
HOLDOUTS GROUP

00:43:09.840 --> 00:43:11.440 line:20%
DU: MR. HE, HURRY OVER!

00:43:12.760 --> 00:43:14.080 line:100%
DU

00:43:14.160 --> 00:43:16.400 line:100%
<i>Mr. He, help me! Get to the cybercafé now!</i>

00:43:19.800 --> 00:43:22.520 line:100%
This man…

00:43:22.600 --> 00:43:24.160 line:100%
OPTICAL

00:43:24.240 --> 00:43:25.440 line:100%
Brat,

00:43:26.400 --> 00:43:27.880 line:100%
listen up.

00:43:28.440 --> 00:43:29.800 line:100%
Move aside right now.

00:43:30.640 --> 00:43:32.200 line:100%
My patience is running out.

00:43:32.960 --> 00:43:35.840 line:100%
Don't come over! Don't come over!

00:43:36.480 --> 00:43:37.200 line:100%
I'll count to three.

00:43:38.360 --> 00:43:39.880 line:100%
If you don't move,

